RuneLite
--------
Source: https://github.com/runelite/runelite
Used in: src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/data/Patch.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/data/Crop.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/data/PatchStateDecoder.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/data/CompostBin.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/data/BinState.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/tracking/FarmingTick.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/tracking/PatchPredictor.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/run/PatchGuide.java,
         src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/supply/BottomlessBucketTracker.java

Patch and compost bin region IDs, extra region IDs, varbit assignments, gardener
NPCs and the Catherby / Falador bounds rules were copied from
runelite-client/.../timetracking/farming/FarmingWorld.java, for every patch type
the plugin runs. Patch-state and compost bin value ranges were copied from
PatchImplementation.java, and crop growth tick rates and stage counts from
Produce.java. The farming tick timing and growth prediction follow
FarmingTracker.java, and the compost chat message patterns in PatchGuide and
BottomlessBucketTracker follow CompostTracker.java.

