Farming-Helper
--------------
Source: https://github.com/Speaax/Farming-Helper
Used in: src/main/java/com/farmrunautopilot/data/PatchPoints.java

The tree, fruit tree and herb patch coordinates were taken from Farming-Helper's
location data classes; all but Weiss's and Harmony Island's were later moved to
the patch objects' positions logged in game. The other patch types' points are
not from Farming-Helper: they're set centres from the OSRS Wiki's maps, and patch
object tiles from mejrs' OSRS cache dump (game data, tools/atlas/patches.tsv).

